      "message": "AFAICT, this CL would enable a malicious host to ramdump a non-debuggable pVM; doesn\u0027t this violate our threat model? Should pvmfw be reworked to conditionally remove `crashkernel` iff the DP doesn\u0027t enable `ramdump` **and** the [mode](http://cs/android/packages/modules/Virtualization/pvmfw/src/dice.rs;l\u003d48;rcl\u003d0a3a8c6e8e0a90c05731eaac6dda374cdbead8f0) is \"normal\" (not debug)?",
