      "message": "I think that change in `microdroid_manager` does that. `microdroid_manager` can read trusted debug policy device tree and debuggble, so its input would be more trustworth. `microdroid_manager` only reads \n\n`pvmfw` is now reading less from the host OS, I believe that it\u0027s more secure. What do you think?",
